            "comprehends": [
             "copies/kr397bv2881#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Stamped, not written; the five figures are plain. A small double-stroke mark like an equals sign stands before them and a dot after, both apparently part of the stamp. Read as 9.12.24 on the dropped-separator convention; 91 as a day would be impossible, so the split is not in doubt"
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
